<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="864101013"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1404868308"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="four"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="FAKY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="four"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:26.155"><div begin="00:25.994" end="03:26.155"><p begin="00:25.994" end="00:27.978" itunes:key="L15944">4 am in the morning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凌晨四点</span></p><p begin="00:28.846" end="00:31.008" itunes:key="L15945">どうして眠れない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辗转难眠</span></p><p begin="00:31.199" end="00:33.757" itunes:key="L15946">こんな bad day, bye-bye black birds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阴郁的日子告别黑鸟</span></p><p begin="00:33.826" end="00:37.543" itunes:key="L15947">呟いても消えない強い不安<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自言自语也难消不安</span></p><p begin="00:38.441" end="00:40.246" itunes:key="L15948">Four hours lately<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数个夜里</span></p><p begin="00:40.417" end="00:43.261" itunes:key="L15949">I've been crying for hours, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲伤哭泣</span></p><p begin="00:44.997" end="00:48.327" itunes:key="L15950">I wish you were here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真希望你能在这里</span></p><p begin="00:50.353" end="00:54.923" itunes:key="L15951">君がくれたAll those letters<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每每翻看</span></p><p begin="00:54.983" end="01:00.933" itunes:key="L15952">読み返すたびに the pain's gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你写的信</span></p><p begin="01:01.184" end="01:06.981" itunes:key="L15953">一人じゃない Cause we are perfect as four<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤单</span></p><p begin="01:07.065" end="01:13.096" itunes:key="L15954">離れ離れでも繋がる believe in you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天涯海角</span></p><p begin="01:13.264" end="01:19.321" itunes:key="L15955">いつも側に感じているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛你</span></p><p begin="01:19.401" end="01:21.305" itunes:key="L15956">Closer to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">靠近我 摘下四叶草</span></p><p begin="01:21.315" end="01:24.152" itunes:key="L15957">And a clover for you</p><p begin="01:24.226" end="01:26.246" itunes:key="L15958">君に幸運を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你献上幸运</span></p><p begin="01:33.320" end="01:35.952" itunes:key="L15959">白み始めた空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天色微亮</span></p><p begin="01:36.495" end="01:38.763" itunes:key="L15960">Under the skyの君が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在这片天空之下</span></p><p begin="01:38.890" end="01:41.497" itunes:key="L15961">泣いてないか気がかりなsilence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这片寂静之中 担心着此刻你是否在哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:41.507" end="01:45.977" itunes:key="L15962">痛みを鎮めて登りゆくdarling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旭日东升 痛楚也渐渐地平复</span></p><p begin="01:46.131" end="01:48.042" itunes:key="L15963">Flowere's lily<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近来时常</span></p><p begin="01:48.052" end="01:51.048" itunes:key="L15964">I've been thinking about you, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念着你</span></p><p begin="01:52.739" end="01:55.956" itunes:key="L15965">I wish you the best of luck<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真希望幸运常伴你左右</span></p><p begin="01:58.096" end="02:02.731" itunes:key="L15966">共に過ごした日々のmemories<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每每想起</span></p><p begin="02:02.741" end="02:08.400" itunes:key="L15967">思い出すたびに I smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你共度的过往回忆</span></p><p begin="02:08.839" end="02:11.741" itunes:key="L15968">You know you're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤独，你还有我们</span></p><p begin="02:11.868" end="02:14.686" itunes:key="L15969">'Cause we are perfect as four<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们心心相印</span></p><p begin="02:14.732" end="02:20.856" itunes:key="L15970">離れ離れでも繋がる you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天涯海角</span></p><p begin="02:20.939" end="02:24.014" itunes:key="L15971">You know you're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道你并不孤单</span></p><p begin="02:24.178" end="02:26.981" itunes:key="L15972">'Cause we are perfect as four<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们心心相印</span></p><p begin="02:27.058" end="02:28.736" itunes:key="L15973">Closer to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">靠近我 摘下四叶草</span></p><p begin="02:28.961" end="02:31.792" itunes:key="L15974">And a clover for you</p><p begin="02:31.864" end="02:34.164" itunes:key="L15975">君に幸運を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你献上幸运</span></p><p begin="02:36.551" end="02:42.338" itunes:key="L15976">一人じゃない Cause we are perfect as four<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不孤单</span></p><p begin="02:42.520" end="02:48.453" itunes:key="L15977">離れ離れでも繋がるbelieve in you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天涯海角</span></p><p begin="02:48.679" end="02:54.525" itunes:key="L15978">いつも側に感じているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛你</span></p><p begin="02:54.639" end="02:56.399" itunes:key="L15979">Closer to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">靠近我 摘下四叶草</span></p><p begin="02:56.707" end="02:59.392" itunes:key="L15980">And a clover for you</p><p begin="02:59.586" end="03:01.905" itunes:key="L15981">君に幸運を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你献上幸运</span></p><p begin="03:01.142" end="03:04.027" itunes:key="L15982">You know you're not alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道你并不孤单</span></p><p begin="03:04.148" end="03:06.973" itunes:key="L15983">'Cause we are perfect as four<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们心心相印</span></p><p begin="03:07.068" end="03:13.134" itunes:key="L15984">離れ離れでも繋がるyou and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天涯海角</span></p><p begin="03:13.222" end="03:16.324" itunes:key="L15985">いつも側に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛你</span></p><p begin="03:16.571" end="03:19.265" itunes:key="L15986">私がいるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直在身边</span></p><p begin="03:19.378" end="03:21.242" itunes:key="L15987">Closer to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">靠近我 摘下四叶草</span></p><p begin="03:21.304" end="03:23.992" itunes:key="L15988">And a clover for you</p><p begin="03:24.197" end="03:26.155" itunes:key="L15989">君に幸運を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你献上幸运</span></p></div></body></tt>